<title>UK: CRICKET-DUKE OF NORFOLK'S XI V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-DUKE OF NORFOLK'S XI V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ARUNDEL, England 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the</p>
<p>one-day tour match between the Duke of Norfolk's XI and</p>
<p>Australia on Thursday:</p>
<p>Australia</p>
<p> M.Waugh c Ward b Whittall	     46</p>
<p> M.Taylor b Emburey			45</p>
<p> S.Waugh st A.Flower b G.Flower	27</p>
<p> R.Ponting b Emburey		     13</p>
<p> J.Langer c Ward b Radford	     22</p>
<p> M.Slater not out			  50</p>
<p> I.Healy not out			   15</p>
<p> Extras (b-8 lb-3 w-5 nb-1)	    17</p>
<p>Total (for five wickets, 50 overs) 235</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-101 2-107 3-143 4-143 5-190</p>
<p>Did not bat: B.Julian. M.Kasprowicz, J.Gillespie, G.McGrath.</p>
<p>Bowling: Radford 10-0-52-1, Foster 7-0-26-0 (3w), Whittall</p>
<p>10-0-45-1, Capel 4-0-21-0, Emburey 10-2-25-2 (2w), G.Flower</p>
<p>9-1-55-1 (1nb)</p>
